      "message": "This is ready for review again after a bit of iteration/flailing around in CI.\n\n* I added the correct commit message trailer to get the longtest builders to run the test\n* I removed the AAAA records from the mock DNS server, the LUCI environment seems to have issues connecting to the IPv6 loopback.\n* I switched to one table-driven unit test instead of multiple tests functions. This required some minor interface tweaks.\n* Per Filippo\u0027s advice I reworked the test so its built on all platforms, but only run in CI for Linux (as opposed to build-gating the whole test).",
