      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-13T12:54:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The top-level test already skips for the wrong platforms so this function shouldn\u0027t be called at all unless there\u0027s some kind of a bug. With that framing in mind it felt more appropriate to panic if it was called. \n\nDoes that line of reasoning resonate with you?",
      "parentUuid": "694bc887_329dc93a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "38dc020fd384c005e262e575bee3a9ce06a384f4",
