      "writtenOn": "2025-06-13T12:43:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Even though we\u0027re just importing ourselves, shouldn\u0027t it be after the standard library by convention?\n\n```suggestion\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"io\"\n\t\"log\"\n\t\"net\"\n\t\"net/http\"\n\t\"os\"\n\t\"os/exec\"\n\t\"path/filepath\"\n\t\"runtime\"\n\t\"strings\"\n\t\"sync\"\n\t\"sync/atomic\"\n\t\"testing\"\n\t\"time\"\n\n\t\"golang.org/x/crypto/acme\"\n```",
      "range": {
