      "message": "Vet doesn\u0027t enforce it because it\u0027s still a bit of a per-project thing (do you put all imports in one blob, do you put stdlib and non-stdlib in their own, do you have three with a separate blob for your local module imports, etc etc etc).\n\nThe style we\u0027ve generally adopted for the stdlib and x/ modules is generally stdlib in one blob, non-stdlib in another blob.",
